{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>伊利沙伯醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>伊利沙伯醫院發生虐兒案。 今日（18日）早上10時43分，一名父親發現6個月大女兒身上有傷痕，翻看家中閉路電視片段後，發現女兒曾遭家傭虐打。他帶女兒到伊利沙伯醫院求醫兼報警求助。警方接報後到場調查，相信女嬰曾遭人掌擱，以涉嫌「虐兒」罪拘捕一名女傭。警方正在調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:18:46.917738+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T06:38:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:17:37.685547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:17:33.226017+00:00","content_hash":"fe4c90e68fbf0cf8839cf7f902b72b45cccbcc6ca28440ae411177dd34a6d3a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}